    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bioneers \u2013 Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique gameplay</strong>\u00a0that combines factory-building with organism simulation.<br>Instead of buildings \u2014 cells, instead of conveyor belts \u2014 vessels, instead of enemies \u2014 viruses. The bigger your organism, the more powerful it becomes \u2014 but it also needs more resources to sustain itself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Animations inspired by real biology.</strong><br>All cell and system movements are based on behavioral models from living organisms, creating a vibrant and believable microworld.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A sandbox without limits.</strong><br>Evolve as you wish: become an aggressive predator, a resilient symbiont, or a peaceful herbivore. Every choice affects your organism's evolutionary path.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Detailed customization.</strong><br>Design your organism cell by cell, optimize systems, balance energy and resource consumption \u2014 you are the true creator of life.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build an Organism from Cells</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create and combine different types of cells: muscle, skin, fat, bone, nerve, and more. Connect them into functional systems \u2014 respiratory, digestive, excretory, and so on. Your goal is to build a perfectly balanced organism capable of survival and development.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833810/extras/81d9cebcc51a2d8fe371098d09e480fa.poster.avif?t=1754653846\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833810/extras/81d9cebcc51a2d8fe371098d09e480fa.webm?t=1754653846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833810/extras/81d9cebcc51a2d8fe371098d09e480fa.mp4?t=1754653846\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Defend Against Viral Attacks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Viruses are dangerous enemies of your organism. Monitor threats, react in time, and produce leukocytes \u2014 your immune defenders. If tissues get infected, the organism could die!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833810/extras/e76b26b2e608a257a638ce3ee78c0b1a.poster.avif?t=1754653846\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833810/extras/e76b26b2e608a257a638ce3ee78c0b1a.webm?t=1754653846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833810/extras/e76b26b2e608a257a638ce3ee78c0b1a.mp4?t=1754653846\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build a Nervous System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To ensure all organs work in sync, connect them into a unified nervous network. From basic sensors to complex neuron clusters \u2014 every cell plays its part. Become the architect of your organism\u2019s instincts and intelligence.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833810/extras/3f010f31a8b0e768868af2660dad5c9f.poster.avif?t=1754653846\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833810/extras/3f010f31a8b0e768868af2660dad5c9f.webm?t=1754653846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833810/extras/3f010f31a8b0e768868af2660dad5c9f.mp4?t=1754653846\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
